&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;The QDrone&apos;s initial position is stored during a model run as its Home Position. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Use the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px; color:#00aa00;&quot;&gt;Mode switch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt; below to select between the Home position and Custom position(s).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;Once in Custom Mode, use the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px; color:#ffaa00;&quot;&gt;Enable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px; color:#ffc000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px; color:#ffaa00;&quot;&gt;switch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt; to enable the particular case. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;When Enable is low, the QDrone will stop following the leader and hover in-place.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
