    <P Name="FontSize">8</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="4482">
    <P Name="Name">1. Joystick Interface: Reads user commands from joystick to arm/disarm and takeoff/land the drone.
2. Data Server: Reads data from the optitrack localization system.  
3. Communication Check: Checks data transfer between mission server and the vehicles.
4. QDrone Command Generation: Generates desired trajectory commands for the QDrone.
5. QBot 2e Data Conditioning: Sends desired drive commands to the QBot 2e.
6. Blackbox: Logs selected data into log file for offline review and analysis.</P>
    <P Name="Position">[61, -28, 512, 55]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-6</P>
  </Annotation>
</System>

