    <P Name="Dst">4016#in:2</P>
  </Line>
  <Annotation SID="2510">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:8px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;1. Place the QBot 2e near the origin of the workspace and turn it ON.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;2. Place the QDrone in the workspace near the QBot 2e and turn it ON (charged battery plugged in).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;3. Ensure that the ESC disable switch is OFF, that is, the ESCs are enabled. This is indicated by a green LED next to the switch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;4. Under the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;MISSION SERVER - LEADER/FOLLOWER with QBot 2e and QDrone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; subsystem, open the the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Joystick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; subsystem, and ensure that the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Host Game Controller&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; block&apos;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Controller Number&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; parameter is set to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;FrSky Simulator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; font-weight:600; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;NOTE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;: In case of unexpected behaviour or emergencies, use the Emergency Stop push button on the Spektrum Joystick to cut all power to the motors (this will result in the drone falling).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;5. Open the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Data Server (Localization)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; subsystem and follow the steps there to set up the correct calibration and rigid body definition files for the selected QBot 2e and QDrone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;6. Under the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;QUARC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; menu, click on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;7. Under the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;QUARC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; menu, click on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;. Wait for the model to start running (takes ~1 to 5 seconds for the Motive API to initialize and send localization data).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;8. In the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;MISSION SERVER - LEADER/FOLLOWER with QBot 2e and QDrone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; subsystem, ensure that the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;isTracking?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; display shows 1 and that the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Joystick Issue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; display shows 0 (joystick must be powered ON with USB dongle attached to the PC). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;9. Start running the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Joystick_Stabilizer_QBot2e_Leader.mdl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; model. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;10. Start running the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Commander_Stabilizer_QDrone_Follower.mdl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; model. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;11. Arm the drone by moving the Arm/Disarm toggle to the 2 position. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;12. Takeoff the drone by moving the Takeoff/Land toggle to the 2 position. The QDrone should takeoff and hover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;13. Drive the QBot 2e around using the joystick handset. Use the RIGHT stick (Roll/Pitch) to drive the QBot 2e forward/backward and turning/yawing.&lt;br /&gt;14. When finished, move the Takeoff/Land toggle to the 0 position to land the drone. The QDrone should land. &lt;br /&gt;15. Move the Arm/Disarm toggle to the 0 position. (the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Commander_Stabilizer_QDrone_Follower.mdl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt; model disarms the drone and stops automatically upon landing).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8px;&quot;&gt;16. Stop the QBot 2e model. Then stop this model. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[-820, 420, -43, 605]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
    <P Name="FixedHeight">on</P>
    <P Name="FixedWidth">on</P>
    <P Name="HorizontalAlignment">left</P>
    <P Name="VerticalAlignment">top</P>
    <P Name="Interpreter">rich</P>
    <P Name="ZOrder">-21</P>
    <P Name="FontName">Arial</P>
    <P Name="FontSize">8</P>
  </Annotation>
  <Annotation SID="3946">
    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:16px; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Quanser Autonomous Vehicles Research Studio&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#c00000;&quot;&gt;Mission Server - Leader/Follwer with QBot 2e and QDrone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</P>
    <P Name="Position">[-561, 364, -86, 400]</P>
    <P Name="InternalMargins">[0, 0, 0, 0]</P>
